{
  "_why": "Declared application-route surface per ROLE. The checker discovers ROLEs from extract/entrypoint.sh and both compose files, boots the app, and compares Rails.application.routes.routes. A ROLE with no entry here is undeclared; an entry for a ROLE that exists nowhere is an orphan.",
